[Task Description]
Define rules that torch.nn.Hardswish API parameters should satisfy. Refer to the API documentation. Particularly, there should be at least one rule to suppress each error message.

Type is encoded as an integer (index of the following list):
[bool, np.int8, np.int16, np.int32, np.int64, np.uint8, np.float16, np.float32, np.float64, np.complex64, np.complex128, str, np.dtype]

